  "description": "Yeseul, a seemingly innocent freshman, harbors something far beyond simple affection. Minhyuk, a boyfriend completely oblivious to the truth, gets caught by Yeseul for starting their relationship through cheating. Stripped of his upper hand, he finds himself increasingly controlled. Amidst anger and confusion, a twisted romance begins anew—and their relationship can never be the same again.\n\n*Note: Part of Crack Entertainment's Gwadabunchul Danpyeonseon (과다분출 단편선) Collection.\n\n*",
